"markdown": "### SquidExtender\n\n**Extend your keyboard, with ChatGPT support.** Brings a powerful toolbar to your keyboard, along with a highly customizable interface and feature set.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
