},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Full ChatGPT Support:** OpenAI, Gemini, DeepSeek, and custom server integrations with streaming output, chat history, and prompt switching.\n- **Extensive Keyboard Actions:** Smart copy, paste, undo/redo, precise cursor navigation, dictation, and Traditional/Simplified Chinese conversion.\n- **Deep Button Customization:** Each button supports tap, swipe, long-press, and pop-up menus tailored to your workflow.\n- **JavaScript Scripting Support:** Free text processing, URL schemes, network requests, clipboard read/write, and Base64/MD5 encoding.\n- **Great Compatibility:** Fully tested on iOS 14.0 - 16.6.1, and compatible with popular tweaks such as Laetus and SwipeExtenderX.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
